## TIM1 Run Order

```c
void TIM1_UP_TIM10_IRQHandler(void) {
    TIM1->SR = 0;

    // Gate: only run inner loops when drive is actively commanding torque
    if (!drive_is_servo_on() && !drive_is_open_loop()) return;

    // Open-loop bypasses control loops — just outputs rotating voltage
    if (drive_is_open_loop()) {
        open_loop_step();
        return;
    }

    // SERVO_ON path: nested loops
    if (++vel_div >= 4) {
        vel_div = 0;
        velocity_step();   // 5 kHz
    }
    current_step();        // 20 kHz
    pwm_apply();           // commit duty cycles
}
```

